### 1. Create Account (Auto DEPOSIT initial cash $10,000)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Main Trading Account",
  "initialCash": 10000.00
}

### 2. Get Account Details (Verify cash balance: $10,000.00)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1

### 3. Buy Stock (NVDA 10 shares * $120.00 = $1,200.00)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "NVDA",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price": 120.00
}

### 4. Re-check Account (Verify reduced cash balance: $8,800.00)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1

### 5. Insufficient Cash Error Test (Attempt $200,000 purchase -> Exception)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "TSLA",
  "quantity": 1000,
  "price": 200.00
}

### 6. Get Transaction History (Verify DEPOSIT -> BUY chronological order)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/transactions